xiatiao-player (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * GTK4 UI + Rust audio backend (IPC over Unix socket).
  * ALSA exclusive output + PipeWire default output.
  * DSD support (native/DoP/PCM soft-decode).
  * Embedded CamillaDSP DSP chain.

